{%- comment -%}
TOOL HEADING — breadcrumb + tab bar for the map tool pages
(Interactive Map, Earthtrack). Used by _layouts/tool_page.html.

Tabs come from _data/tool-heading/index.yml (title, url, icon).
Each tab is a plain link; the one matching the current page is
highlighted. To add a tab back later, add an entry to that file —
icon is "map" or "pin" (drawn inline below, no image files needed).

Breadcrumbs come from the page's own `breadcrumb:` front matter,
same as directory pages.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if page.breadcrumb -%}
<nav class="page-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
  <div class="container-fluid tool-tabs-inner">
    {% for crumb in page.breadcrumb %}
      {% unless forloop.first %}<span class="page-breadcrumb-sep">/</span>{% endunless %}
      {% if forloop.last %}
        <span class="page-breadcrumb-current">{{ crumb.label }}</span>
      {% else %}
        <a class="page-breadcrumb-link" href="{% if crumb.url contains 'http' %}{{ crumb.url }}{% else %}{{ crumb.url | relative_url }}{% endif %}">{{ crumb.label }}</a>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</nav>
{%- endif -%}

<section class="tool-tabs">
  <div class="container-fluid tool-tabs-inner">
    <nav class="tool-tabs-row" aria-label="Map tools">
      {% for item in site.data.tool-heading.index %}
        {% assign tab_url = item.url | relative_url %}
        {% assign here = page.url | relative_url %}
        <a class="tool-tab{% if here == tab_url %} is-active{% endif %}" href="{{ tab_url }}"{% if here == tab_url %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>
          {% if item.icon == "map" %}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 4 3.5 6v14L9 18l6 2 5.5-2V4L15 6 9 4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 4v14M15 6v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/></svg>
          {% elsif item.icon == "pin" %}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11.5A7 7 0 0 1 19 9.5C19 14.8 12 21 12 21Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/></svg>
          {% endif %}
          <span>{{ item.title }}</span>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%}
Sidebar button on the map pages ("Get the data"): send it to the
Develop page data section. Done here rather than in the sidebar
files so the Earthtrack / map sidebars themselves stay untouched.
Runs before the sidebar's own click handler and stops it.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script>
  document.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
    var btn = e.target.closest && e.target.closest('#learningResourceButton');
    if (!btn) return;
    e.preventDefault();
    e.stopPropagation();
    window.location.href = "{{ site.data['tool-analyze-the-data-map-sidebar'].index.learning_resources.data_url | relative_url }}";
  }, true);
</script>
